    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Job Replies: The Wicked Do Prosper"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then Job answered and said:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Keep listening to my words,",
          "and let this be your comfort."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Bear with me, and I will speak,",
          "and after I have spoken, mock on."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "As for me, is my complaint against man?",
          "Why should I not be impatient?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Look at me and be appalled,",
          "and lay your hand over your mouth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When I remember, I am dismayed,",
          "and shuddering seizes my flesh."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Why do the wicked live,",
          "reach old age, and grow mighty in power?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Their offspring are established in their presence,",
          "and their descendants before their eyes."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Their houses are safe from fear,",
          "and no rod of God is upon them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Their bull breeds without fail;",
          "their cow calves and does not miscarry."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They send out their little boys like a flock,",
          "and their children dance."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They sing to the tambourine and the lyre",
          "and rejoice to the sound of the pipe."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They spend their days in prosperity,",
          "and in peace they go down to Sheol."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They say to God, ‘Depart from us!",
          "We do not desire the knowledge of your ways."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "What is the Almighty, that we should serve him?",
          "And what profit do we get if we pray to him?’"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Behold, is not their prosperity in their hand?",
          "The counsel of the wicked is far from me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“How often is it that the lamp of the wicked is put out?",
          "That their calamity comes upon them?",
          "That God distributes pains in his anger?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "That they are like straw before the wind,",
          "and like chaff that the storm carries away?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You say, ‘God stores up their iniquity for their children.’",
          "Let him pay it out to them, that they may know it."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let their own eyes see their destruction,",
          "and let them drink of the wrath of the Almighty."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For what do they care for their houses after them,",
          "when the number of their months is cut off?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Will any teach God knowledge,",
          "seeing that he judges those who are on high?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "One dies in his full vigor,",
          "being wholly at ease and secure,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "his pails full of milk",
          "and the marrow of his bones moist."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Another dies in bitterness of soul,",
          "never having tasted of prosperity."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They lie down alike in the dust,",
          "and the worms cover them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Behold, I know your thoughts",
          "and your schemes to wrong me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For you say, ‘Where is the house of the prince?",
          "Where is the tent in which the wicked lived?’"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          29
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Have you not asked those who travel the roads,",
          "and do you not accept their testimony"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          30
        ],
        "lines": [
          "that the evil man is spared in the day of calamity,",
          "that he is rescued in the day of wrath?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          31
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Who declares his way to his face,",
          "and who repays him for what he has done?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          32
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When he is carried to the grave,",
          "watch is kept over his tomb."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          33
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The clods of the valley are sweet to him;",
          "all mankind follows after him,",
          "and those who go before him are innumerable."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          34
        ],
        "lines": [
          "How then will you comfort me with empty nothings?",
          "There is nothing left of your answers but falsehood.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
